 # Socket.IO Contracts - Stable API Reference

+## WebSocket Path
+
+**Path:** `/llamaproxws`
+
+The Socket.IO server is mounted at the `/llamaproxws` path. All clients must connect to this path:
+
+```javascript
+const socket = io({
+  path: "/llamaproxws",
+  transports: ["websocket"]
+});
+```
+
